    <bpmn:process id="W_W3817" name="W3817. Apprenticeship Cohort Planning, Scheduling &amp; Resource Allocation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cohort intake (W3814); program calendar
Frequency: Per cohort + ongoing
Volume: Apprentice cohorts per year
Owner: Trade Capability / L&amp;D
Participants: Trade Capability, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC Ops (links to VS-04), HR (links to VS-19), Finance (links to VS-17.4), In-Store Services (links to VS-09)
Source: workflow W3817 — Apprenticeship Cohort Planning, Scheduling &amp; Resource Allocation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3817_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3817_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
