    <bpmn:process id="W_W3818" name="W3818. Apprentice On-the-Job Training, Rotation &amp; Store Assignment Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cohort start (W3817); rotation cycle
Frequency: Continuous (per cohort)
Volume: Active apprentice cohort
Owner: Trade Capability / Store Ops
Participants: Trade Capability, Store Ops (links to VS-07), Master Tradespersons/Mentors (links to W3820), In-Store Services (links to VS-09), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), HSE (links to VS-24)
Source: workflow W3818 — Apprentice On-the-Job Training, Rotation &amp; Store Assignment Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3818_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3818_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3818_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3818_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3818_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3818_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3818_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3818_Start3" name="Cohort start (W3817); rotation cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3818_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3818_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Store-Ops execute on-the-job training: department rotation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Store-Ops execute on-the-job training: department rotation, supervised practice at the lumber yard, tile gallery, plumbing/electrical, paint-tinting station, tools wall, and fabrication/estimation bay (links to VS-09.1/VS-09.2), under mentor supervision (links to W3820)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Store Ops / Mentors
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3818_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3818_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3818_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Mentors log competencies practiced and signed off against the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Mentors log competencies practiced and signed off against the curriculum (links to W3810/W3815), capturing evidence (work samples, supervisor sign-off) for assessment (links to W3819)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Mentors / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3818_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3818_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3818_Task6" name="Trade Capability/Store-Ops integrate apprentices into store operations safely…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability/Store-Ops integrate apprentices into store operations safely and productively (age/role-appropriate tasks, supervision, customer interaction standards) without compromising service (links to VS-07) or safety (links to W3823)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Store Ops / HSE
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3818_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3818_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3818_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3818_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3818_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-599 (ensure controlled execution — Apprenticeship Cohort Operations, Mentorship &amp; Competency Assessment (PA-123.2).) | - operational: mentor sign-off required on each competency unit; on-the-job hours logged and auditable against TESDA requirements
Owner: Trade Capability / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
