    <bpmn:process id="W_W3820" name="W3820. Mentor / Master-Tradesperson Network &amp; Coaching Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program (W3809); mentor capacity need
Frequency: Maintained + ongoing
Volume: Mentor/master-tradesperson network
Owner: Trade Capability / Store Ops
Participants: Trade Capability, Store Ops (links to VS-07), Master Tradespersons, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), HR (links to VS-102/VS-103), Recognition (links to W630)
Source: workflow W3820 — Mentor / Master-Tradesperson Network &amp; Coaching Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3820_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3820_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3820_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3820_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3820_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3820_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3820_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3820_Start3" name="Program (W3809); mentor capacity need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3820_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3820_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Store-Ops build and maintain the mentor/master-tradesperson…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Store-Ops build and maintain the mentor/master-tradesperson network: identify and qualify master tradespersons per trade/store, define mentor role and time commitment, and balance mentor capacity with apprentice cohorts (links to W3817)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3820_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3820_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3820_Task5" name="Trade Capability/L&amp;D train and certify mentors/coaches (coaching skills…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/L&amp;D train and certify mentors/coaches (coaching skills, assessment consistency links to W3828), recognize and reward mentor contribution (links to W630, and compensation links to VS-102 where applicable)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / L&amp;D / HR
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
