    <bpmn:process id="W_W3824" name="W3824. Apprenticeship Vendor/Product Training Integration &amp; Sponsorship" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor cycle; product launch; sponsorship opportunity
Frequency: Ongoing
Volume: Vendor/product training within apprenticeship
Owner: Trade Capability / Merchandising
Participants: Trade Capability, Merchandising (links to VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Retail Media (links to VS-48), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Compliance/ABC (links to VS-86.3)
Source: workflow W3824 — Apprenticeship Vendor/Product Training Integration &amp; Sponsorship</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3824_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3824_Lane1" name="Trade Capability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3824_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3824_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3824_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3824_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3824_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3824_Start3" name="Vendor cycle; product launch; sponsorship opportunity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3824_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3824_Task4" name="Trade Capability/Merchandising integrate vendor and product training into the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Capability/Merchandising integrate vendor and product training into the apprenticeship: vendor-led product/brand training (power tools, paint, electrical, appliances), new-product-launch familiarization (links to VS-01.1), and category expertise — complementing BuildRight&#x27;s own curriculum (links to W3810)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Merchandising / Vendors
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3824_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3824_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3824_Task5" name="Trade Capability/Vendor-Mgmt manage vendor sponsorship and funded-training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade Capability/Vendor-Mgmt manage vendor sponsorship and funded-training governance: vendor sponsorship of tools/kits/curriculum, compliant with anti-bribery (links to VS-86.3) and brand-neutrality (no vendor favoritism in selling — links to VS-124), and documented
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Vendor Mgmt / Compliance
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3824_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3824_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3824_Task6" name="Trade Capability measure vendor-training effectiveness and apprentice product…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trade Capability measure vendor-training effectiveness and apprentice product knowledge (links to W3819/W3832), and report to merchandising/vendor-scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Trade Capability / Merchandising / Analytics
Accountable (A): Trade Capability Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3824_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3824_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3824_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3824_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3824_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-599 (ensure controlled execution — Apprenticeship Cohort Operations, Mentorship &amp; Competency Assessment (PA-123.2).) | - operational: brand-neutrality and balanced curriculum; operational: ABC governance (links to VS-86)
Owner: Trade Capability / Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
